sentences.t:
τί κεν ῥέξειε καὶ ἄλλος,
ὁππότ’ ἀνὴρ τοιοῦτος ἔχων μελεδήματα θυμῷ
αἰτίζῃ;

sentences.l:
Nor do you hear at all, of your fathers,
from the time before, since you are children,
what sort of man Odysseus was among your own parents,

who first lost a noble husband, lion-hearted,
distinguished by virtues of every kind among the Danaans,
noble — whose fame is wide throughout Hellas and mid-Argos;
